{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GET YOKED is a <strong>Roguelike</strong>, <strong>Deckbuilder</strong> game about becoming an <strong>ABSOLUTE UNIT</strong>.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2025-01-23_15-22-29_7.gif?t=1744801450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SWOLATRO: The world's first Comedy Deckbuilder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think Balatro meets Slay the Spire, but with gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A storytelling machine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you skip helping your mom so that you can keep working your glutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2025-01-23_15-22-29_10.gif?t=1744801450\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow, and sculpt your body to win competitions. Reach the minimum gains required to win.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play workout cards to get <strong>Gains</strong>, e.g., play Arms to grow those guns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't push too hard \u2014 too much <strong>Fatigue</strong> can lead to <strong>Injury</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play rest and supplement cards to increase your <strong>Gains</strong> or decrease muscle <strong>Fatigue</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Really into your Glutes? No problem become a Glutes purist and get those buns hun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The journey to <strong>Gains</strong>-Town is difficult, make smart decisions on your journey to become an <strong>ABSOLUTE UNIT</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONTENT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play four different starting bodybuilders. Each with their own deck and playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The definitive Bodybuilder Roguelike experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 200 cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization: complete competitions and unlock shorts, tattoos, hairstyles, shoes, and gloves to personalize your Bodybuilders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-depth campaign mode complete with harder difficulties, as well daily, endless, challenge and seeded runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2025-01-23_15-22-29_9.gif?t=1744801450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594610?t=1744801450","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594610?t=1744801450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/387642c60a2afdbcecfb0ea802cb6804ec2eeac3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744801450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/387642c60a2afdbcecfb0ea802cb6804ec2eeac3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744801450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GET YOKED is a <strong>Roguelike</strong>, <strong>Deckbuilder</strong> game about becoming an <strong>ABSOLUTE UNIT</strong>.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594610/extras/2025-01-23_15-22-29_7.gif?t=1744801450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SWOLATRO: The world's first Comedy Deckbuilder.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think Bal